  "body": "Beautifully presented in the sought-after Stratmill development, this modern single-level home offers easy-care living, everyday comfort and a relaxed coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\n*Property Docs (copy & paste the link below into your browser & scroll down): \r\nhttps://rwmairangibay.co.nz/MRG36169\r\n\r\nThe sunny north-facing lounge welcomes natural light, while the open-plan kitchen and dining area create an inviting space for family living and entertaining. Stylish built-in cabinetry, central air conditioning and a private backyard add to the home's comfort and appeal.\r\n\r\nProperty Features:\r\n- Three bedrooms and two bathrooms, including a master ensuite\r\n- Modern single-level, easy-care living\r\n- Sunny north-facing lounge\r\n- Open-plan kitchen and dining\r\n- Central air conditioning\r\n- Built-in TV unit and display cabinetry\r\n- Private backyard for year-round enjoyment\r\n- Internal-access garage + Flexible parking\r\n- EV charging wiring provision\r\n- Intercom system\r\n- Master Build 10-Year Guarantee\r\n\r\nConveniently located just minutes from Orewa Beach, cafés, shops and motorway access, and zoned for Orewa College.\r\n\r\nIdeal for first-home buyers, downsizers or investors.\r\n\r\nOur motivated vendors are ready to sell - present your offer!",
